         <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport page 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724674\/width\/508\/height\/381\" style=\"width: 429px; height: 321px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport page 2 & 3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724677\/width\/547\/height\/409\" style=\"width: 428px; height: 320px;\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport page 4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724683\/width\/584\/height\/436\" style=\"width: 428px; height: 319px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> (I was going to start a website and then changed my mind so ignore the URL across the pictures lol)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Cover Only.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724701\/width\/600\/height\/429\" style=\"width: 425px; height: 304px;\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724703\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 424px; height: 303px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724705\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 422px; height: 301px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_7399.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724695\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 425px; height: 317px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_7393.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724698\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 425px; height: 317px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Reply Card Front.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724707\/width\/524\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 325px; height: 433px;\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Reply Card Back.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724712\/width\/522\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 324px; height: 430px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Luggage Tag Bells.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724714\/width\/490\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 458px;\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Luggage Tag Front.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724717\/width\/490\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 458px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> (Mad Lib Front)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Luggage Tag Mad Lib.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724719\/width\/490\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 459px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> (Mad Lib Back)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Luggage Tag Mad Lib Back.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724721\/width\/490\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 455px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Reply Card Envelope.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724725\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 442px; height: 330px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"parrish.chelsea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.197.233.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1311376202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242658.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GatorGirl1","Id":242658,"Name":"GatorGirl1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e66418b4c28366a17911c9c757b983c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"EnvelopeFront.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724729\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 365px; height: 272px;\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"EnvelopeBack.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724732\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 385px; height: 287px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Boarding Pass.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724738\/width\/402\/height\/351\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Save-the-Date Magnet.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724740\/width\/510\/height\/295\" style=\"width: 431px; height: 249px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582090,"PostDate":1329173240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"EnvelopeFront.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724729\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 365px; height: 272px;\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"EnvelopeBack.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724732\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 385px; height: 287px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Boarding Pass.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724738\/width\/402\/height\/351\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Save-the-Date Magnet.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/724740\/width\/510\/height\/295\" style=\"width: 431px; height: 249px;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"parrish.chelsea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.197.233.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1311376202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242658.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GatorGirl1","Id":242658,"Name":"GatorGirl1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55f891b64ef317320f752fe8bf0bad53","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s the template!!! I moved everything out of photoshop and into word so everyone can use it. Make sure you print the 2nd page on the back of the 1st page and replace my pictures and words with your own!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Materials: We ordered all the paper and envelopes from paper and more in metallic pearlescent pearl white&lt;span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;color and the pink azalea color! The inside pages of the passport are text weight and the outside cover of the passport is a heavier card stock. We printed it ourselves on our laser printer, we tried an ink jet printer first but the colors didn&#039;t come out bright enough. We downloaded a couple fonts from that Dafont.com website. If you would like the names just let me know and I&#039;ll look them up!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Binding passports: After experimenting with glue, staples, and ribbon we ended up ordering white staples online and using those to bind the passports. We didn&#039;t like the way the ribbon looked and the glue was a little messy. The staples definitely held it together the prettiest and we stapled it on the edge so you can&#039;t even see them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;11450&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Passport Template.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Customize by adding your own pictures and words! Print 2nd page on back of 1st page! 3rd page is cover (recommend using cardstock or a heavier paper for this page)&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;42&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582096,"PostDate":1329174076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here's the template!!! I moved everything out of photoshop and into word so everyone can use it. Make sure you print the 2nd page on the back of the 1st page and replace my pictures and words with your own!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Materials: We ordered all the paper and envelopes from paper and more in metallic pearlescent pearl white<span> <\/span>color and the pink azalea color! The inside pages of the passport are text weight and the outside cover of the passport is a heavier card stock. We printed it ourselves on our laser printer, we tried an ink jet printer first but the colors didn't come out bright enough. We downloaded a couple fonts from that Dafont.com website. If you would like the names just let me know and I'll look them up!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Binding passports: After experimenting with glue, staples, and ribbon we ended up ordering white staples online and using those to bind the passports. We didn't like the way the ribbon looked and the glue was a little messy. The staples definitely held it together the prettiest and we stapled it on the edge so you can't even see them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"11450\",\"name\":\"Passport Template.doc\",\"description\":\"Customize by adding your own pictures and words! Print 2nd page on back of 1st page! 3rd page is cover (recommend using cardstock or a heavier paper for this page)\",\"size\":\"42\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"parrish.chelsea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.197.233.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1311376202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242658.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GatorGirl1","Id":242658,"Name":"GatorGirl1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb47131627393db633204e07c2182b67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would love to see the template to see if thats something I could use for my wedding but I&#039;m unable to open the link of the template.&amp;nbsp; Would you be able to email me the template, please. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:nunez.jeannette@gmail.com\"&gt;nunez.jeannette@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582229,"PostDate":1329199926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would love to see the template to see if thats something I could use for my wedding but I'm unable to open the link of the template.\u00a0 Would you be able to email me the template, please. <a href='mailto:nunez.jeannette@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>nunez.jeannette@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nunez.jeannette@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.129.93.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302959438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238928.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":101,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jnunez","Id":238928,"Name":"jnunez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d92b8745aa1b6c9acfe5ba1aa699886","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_7406.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725193\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 367px; height: 274px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_7409.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725195\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 367px; height: 273px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Cover Only.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725199\/width\/600\/height\/429\" style=\"width: 369px; height: 263px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (Ignore the URL - was going to make a website but I changed my mind)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725201\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 371px; height: 264px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725203\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 264px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582245,"PostDate":1329224400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_7406.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725193\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 367px; height: 274px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_7409.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725195\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 367px; height: 273px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Cover Only.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725199\/width\/600\/height\/429\" style=\"width: 369px; height: 263px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> (Ignore the URL - was going to make a website but I changed my mind)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725201\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 371px; height: 264px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Passport Invitation Page 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/725203\/width\/600\/height\/428\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 264px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"parrish.chelsea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.197.233.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1311376202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242658.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GatorGirl1","Id":242658,"Name":"GatorGirl1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"454e7dc36f08585a65e7a27a596deaa6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Since I&#039;m new, my post with all the pictures is being held for moderation. If you can&#039;t wait that long, all my pictures are also on a previous thread that I started and in an album on my profile :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582247,"PostDate":1329224901,"PostC