in-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Envelope liners - wedding themed wrapping paper (walmart)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_715\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Wrap around labels - ivory cardstock, stamp &amp;nbsp;(michaels)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_713\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_729\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Boarding Passes - Metallic Cream Linen Cardstock (paperandmore)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_711\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Ticket Jackets and Ceremony Programs &amp;nbsp;- Metallic Lagoon Cardstock (paperandmore)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_709\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Envelopes - Metallic Bronze #10 and Metallic Lagoon 4 bar (envelopemall)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_707\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_705\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-le