"&lt;p&gt; May I ask how much the material cost you in total.I want to do this but I&#039;m debating whether the cost for DIY will be close to getting them made by a private company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mayra&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1660627,"PostDate":1346938633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> May I ask how much the material cost you in total.I want to do this but I'm debating whether the cost for DIY will be close to getting them made by a private company.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Mayra\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"myxticixmo@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346938567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260031.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"morenia20","Id":260031,"Name":"morenia20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fa77fdfbc18c2297f659f0be71973d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Do you still have the template?&amp;nbsp; Can it only be used on a Mac?&amp;nbsp; I sent to Ayleebits and paid the ten dollars, but got nothing and was unable to leave a message there.&amp;nbsp; If you can help in any way I would greatly appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:upstatelass@hotmail.com\"&gt;upstatelass@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1681414,"PostDate":1351790433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Do you still have the template?\u00a0 Can it only be used on a Mac?\u00a0 I sent to Ayleebits and paid the ten dollars, but got nothing and was unable to leave a message there.\u00a0 If you can help in any way I would greatly appreciate it.<\/p> <p> <a href='mailto:upstatelass@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>upstatelass@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"upstatelass@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351789959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261967.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thecat","Id":261967,"Name":"thecat","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56fd3e6651f45c775c9d707a00c90fcd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I love the passports. You did a great job! Do you mind sending me the template? I waa debating if I should make them myself or just get them printed.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bride-to-be&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Audrey&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Audrey4837@aol.com\"&gt;Audrey4837@aol.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1692833,"PostDate":1354809886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I love the passports. You did a great job! Do you mind sending me the template? I waa debating if I should make them myself or just get them printed.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bride-to-be<\/p> <p> Audrey<\/p> <p> <a href='mailto:Audrey4837@aol.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Audrey4837@aol.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Audrey4837@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1353495480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262573.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Denise7481","Id":262573,"Name":"Denise7481","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43856bd16eb4920223c628a02c400737","RawContent":"&lt