kes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba00d8aba1fe76f8e2715a32595d0118","RawContent":"Looks great!! Wow..","Attachments":[],"Id":1789948,"PostDate":1376202829,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Looks great!! Wow..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cocobunny525@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.54.104.187","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1320229157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247305.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cocoluv","Id":247305,"Name":"cocoluv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"683a39b2397d5e0aa9cd5934be5408ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow what an amazing job! I really want to do passport invites (instead of STDs)! I really hope I can manage...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can I ask.. how did you do the rounded corners? And what programe did you use to work on the template? I&#039;ve that powerpoint is quite easy, but not sure if I should be using something else?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks and congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1792881,"PostDate":1376914441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow what an amazing job! I really want to do passport invites (instead of STDs)! I really hope I can manage...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can I ask.. how did you do the rounded corners? And what programe did you use to work on the template? I've that powerpoint is quite easy, but not sure if I should be using something else?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks and congrats!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xarocas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.24.83.173","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376041591,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272399.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Xarocas","Id":272399,"Name":"Xarocas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.232.1.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c4a47e04cc2edd46472832a001d2e0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857370,"PostDate":1404078158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n             